#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:3
msgid ""
"PySME can be installed through PyPI (recommended; stable release) or from"
" GitHub source."
msgstr "PySME 可以通过 PyPI 安装（推荐，稳定版），也可以从 GitHub 源码安装。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:5
msgid "Supported environments:"
msgstr "支持的环境："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:6
msgid "Platforms: Linux, macOS (arm platform only)"
msgstr "平台：Linux、macOS（仅 arm 平台）"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:7
msgid ""
"The x86/Intel platform macOS is not supported anymore, but you can still "
"install v0.6.23, the last supported PySME version, or download "
"[SMElib](https://github.com/SpectroscopyMadeEasy/SMElib) and compile it "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"x86/Intel 平台的 macOS 已不再受支持；如果你需要旧版本，可安装 v0.6.23（最后一个支持该平台的 "
"PySME 版本），或者下载 [SMElib](https://github.com/SpectroscopyMadeEasy/SMElib) "
"并手动编译。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:8
msgid "Windows: supported via WSL2 (install/run PySME inside the Linux subsystem)"
msgstr "Windows：通过 WSL2 支持，也就是在 Linux 子系统中安装和运行 PySME"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:9
msgid "Python versions:"
msgstr "Python 版本："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:10
msgid "3.9–3.13."
msgstr "3.9 到 3.13。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:13
msgid "Set up virtual environment"
msgstr "创建虚拟环境"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:15
msgid "This step is optional but recommended."
msgstr "这一步不是强制的，但推荐这样做。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:17
msgid "conda"
msgstr "conda"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:24
msgid "venv (alternative)"
msgstr "venv（可选）"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:31
msgid "Install PySME"
msgstr "安装 PySME"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:33
msgid "Stable release (recommended)"
msgstr "稳定版（推荐）"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:39
msgid "From GitHub source (latest)"
msgstr "从 GitHub 源码安装（最新版本）"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:41
msgid "Clone the repository"
msgstr "克隆仓库"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:48
msgid "Install PySME from source"
msgstr "从源码安装 PySME"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:55
msgid "If you already cloned without submodules, run:"
msgstr "如果你之前克隆仓库时没有带上 submodules，请执行："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:61
msgid "From GitHub source (specific release tag)"
msgstr "从 GitHub 源码安装（指定 release tag）"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:63
msgid "Use this for reproducible source installs:"
msgstr "如果你需要可复现的源码安装，可以使用下面的方式："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:73
msgid "Legacy source versions"
msgstr "旧版源码"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:75
msgid ""
"For older source versions that predate the new repository layout, use the"
" legacy repository:"
msgstr "对于更早、尚未使用当前仓库结构的源码版本，请使用 legacy 仓库："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:85
msgid ""
"For very old tags, if build metadata is incomplete, follow the historical"
" notes in the legacy docs."
msgstr "如果是非常老的 tag，构建元数据可能不完整，这时请参考 legacy 文档中的历史说明。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:87
msgid "Verify installation"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:93
msgid "You should see an output of `PySME version: [version]`."
msgstr "你应该会看到类似 `PySME version: [version]` 的输出。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:95
msgid "Configure data directories (optional)"
msgstr "配置数据目录（可选）"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:97
msgid ""
"PySME stores atmosphere/NLTE/cache files under `~/.sme/` by default. To "
"use a different location, edit `~/.sme/config.json`:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，PySME 会把 atmosphere、NLTE 和缓存文件存放在 `~/.sme/` 下。如果你想使用别的位置，请编辑 "
"`~/.sme/config.json`："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:108
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "说明："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:110
msgid "`~` can be used in these paths."
msgstr "这些路径里可以使用 `~`。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:111
msgid "Updating paths does not move existing downloaded files automatically."
msgstr "修改路径不会自动搬迁已经下载的文件。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:113
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:115
msgid "You can uninstall PySME by:"
msgstr "你可以用下面的命令卸载 PySME："

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:121
msgid ""
"Note that several files (data file, SMElib file etc) will remain after "
"the uninstall.  They are all list in the output of the pip command, and "
"it is recommended to remove them manually."
msgstr ""
"卸载后，一些文件仍然会保留在系统里，例如数据文件和 SMElib 文件。它们都会列在 `pip` 命令的输出中，通常建议手动清理。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:125
msgid "The content below to be removed."
msgstr "下面这部分内容后续应移除。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:127
msgid "Running SME"
msgstr "运行 SME"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:128
msgid ""
"An simple minimum example is provided in the [examples "
"directory](https://github.com/SpectroscopyMadeEasy/PySME/tree/master/examples)."
" Make sure to also download the provided input structure."
msgstr ""
"[examples "
"目录](https://github.com/SpectroscopyMadeEasy/PySME/tree/master/examples) "
"中提供了一个简单的最小示例。记得同时下载配套提供的输入结构。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:129
msgid "You can then run it with: `python minimum.py`"
msgstr "然后你可以用下面的命令运行它：`python minimum.py`"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:132
msgid ""
"PySME requires a **pre-compiled C++/Fortran SME library**. Wheels are "
"currently provided for Linux and macOS.   For Windows, we recommend using"
" **WSL2** (install PySME inside the Linux environment)."
msgstr ""
"PySME 运行时依赖一个**预编译的 C++/Fortran SME 库**。目前官方 wheel 支持 Linux 和 macOS。"
"对于 Windows，我们建议使用 **WSL2**，也就是在 Linux 环境中安装并运行 PySME。"

#: ../../getting_started/installation.md:136
msgid ""
"PySME requires the pre-compled C++/Fortran SME library to run. Currently "
"we deliver SME library with Linux and Mac version; for Windows users, we "
"recommend to use WSL and hence the Linux version."
msgstr ""
"PySME 运行时依赖预编译的 C++/Fortran SME 库。目前我们提供 Linux 和 Mac 版本的 SME 库；对于 Windows "
"用户，建议使用 WSL，因此实际使用的是 Linux 版本。"
